@startuml measurement_plugin
title Measurement Through an External Package
autonumber

actor Operator as User
participant "Main UI" as UI
participant "Port assignment / transport registry" as Ports
participant "Plugin host" as Host
participant PluginManager as PM
participant "External instrument" as Instrument
participant "Workspace persistence" as Workspace

User -> UI : select measurement and start
UI -> Ports : resolve selected port and assigned plugin
Ports --> UI : transport + plugin identity
UI -> Host : activate measurement plugin
Host -> PM : resolve package and create instance
PM --> Host : validated descriptor / plugin API
Host -> PM : invoke through EF800 contract
PM -> Instrument : protocol request through host transport
Instrument --> PM : response bytes
PM --> Host : structured result
Host -> Host : validate result bounds and fields
Host --> UI : result or diagnostic
UI -> Workspace : append accepted result when requested
Workspace --> UI : persistence status
UI --> User : render result / error
UI -> Host : deactivate / release session
Host -> PM : destroy instance and release resources
@enduml
